within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.P_AntiparasiticProductsInsecticidesAndRepellents.P01C_AgentsAgainstLeishmaniasisAndTrypanosomiasis.P01CX04_Miltefosine;
model Miltefosine_Madu2023_PD_pbmc_concentration
  "linear exposure-response sweep — Madu_2023 :: PBMC concentration (Miltefosine intracellular concentration in PBMCs)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Interfaces.PartialExposureResponseSweep(
    E0 = 0,      // [kg/m3; µg/mL × 0.001]
    Emax = 0, EC50 = 1,      // unused by a line
    exposure_per_s = 0.001);
  parameter Real slope = 0.8   "[1]";
equation
  response = E0 + slope*exposure;
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 1000, Interval = 2),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Miltefosine_Madu2023_PD_pbmc_concentration</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Madu SJ et al., <i>Pharmaceutical research 40(12):2983–3000</i> 2023 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11095-023-03610-0\">doi:10.1007/s11095-023-03610-0</a>) — Miltefosine intracellular concentration in PBMCs [µg/mL] against miltefosine µg/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: linear.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =          0 µg/mL    drug-free response (baseline) (E0 (Baseline effect), Q324)
  slope =        0.8          change in response per unit of exposure (α (activation constant enhancement factor for bound receptor), Q335)</pre><p>The algebra is <code>response = E0 + slope*exposure</code>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one µg/mL of miltefosine per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 0   (drug-free)</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Madu_2023: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Miltefosine_Madu2023_PD_pbmc_concentration;
